      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KINGSBRAE TED (4) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 5.5 lengths at this track in a handy 16.93 beating ICE ON FIRE. Has a strong record out of this box with four wins and a minor placing from five starts. Hard to go past. ICE ON FIRE (2) comes here following a placing in speedy time (17.30) over 300m at this track when beaten 5.5 lengths in a NG. Bold showing expected again. CALLA NAUGHTY (1) held a forward position from the pinch but began to paddle on the bend and drifted out of the finish when 5th at this track in NG company. Solid record here at the distance winning seven races. Has the ability to give this a shake. BUNDY BLUE (7) was out of placings last time (23.93) at Casino in a Free For All, finishing fourth and beaten 8 lengths. Has four wins already from this draw.",
